# ── OS ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
._*
Thumbs.db

# ── Secrets ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# WiFi credentials, API tokens, and Home Assistant keys used in workshop
# firmware. Each project commits a `secrets.h.example` alongside instead, which
# this does not match.
.env
.env.local
secrets.h
*.pem
*.key

# ── PlatformIO ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Build output plus the toolchains, frameworks, and lib_deps PlatformIO
# downloads into .pio/libdeps/ — all regenerated by `pio run`. A project's own
# lib/ holds hand-written private libraries and stays tracked.
.pio/
.pioenvs/
.piolibdeps/
.clang_complete
.gcc-flags.json
compile_commands.json

# ── C / C++ build artifacts ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# PlatformIO already keeps its output under .pio/; these catch stray artifacts
# from a hand-run compiler. Deliberately absent: *.bin, *.hex, *.elf — those are
# the prebuilt images we hand to attendees whose toolchain will not cooperate.
*.o
*.obj
*.map
*.a
*.d

# ── Editors ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea/
*.swp
*~

# ── Transient agent state ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
CERBERUS.md

# Subagent git worktrees. Anchored (leading slash) so it matches only the
# repo-root directory the agent runner creates, never a nested path.
/.claude/worktrees/
